        <h1 className="text-2xl font-semibold mb-2 text-white">
          You're offline
        </h1>
        <p className="text-zinc-400 mb-6">
          Sisonkhe will sync your changes automatically when you reconnect.
          Any work you do now is safely stored on this device.
